  "question": {
    "text": "Considering only the principal values of inverse functions, the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
